{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29790","headline":"正月崇让宅 · 李商隐","name":"正月崇让宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密锁重关掩绿苔，廊深阁迥此徘徊。\n先知风起月含晕，尚自露寒花未开。\n蝙拂帘旌终展转，鼠翻牕网小惊猜。\n背灯独共余香语，不觉犹歌起夜来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}